        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of characteristic beaded hair shafts on microscopy plus clinical hair fragility and patchy alopecia",
    "notes": "Genetic testing for mutations in hair keratin genes (KRT81, KRT83, KRT86) can support diagnosis"
